{
  "name": "Airtable table to Google Sheets sync (hourly)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d6209de1-5c3c-5968-b9ed-5826f34191a1",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"airtable_base_url\": \"https://airtable.com/appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\",\n    \"airtable_table_url\": \"https://airtable.com/appXXXXXXXXXXXXXX/tblXXXXXXXXXXXXXX\",\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Airtable copy\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "48e0820a-b30e-5d13-ac77-5d925f8c51ec",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "search",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.airtable_base_url }}"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.airtable_table_url }}"
        },
        "returnAll": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "8b041493-0e06-5ed7-bc3f-8c749e75de09",
      "name": "Get Airtable records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(({ json: r }) => {\n  const out = { airtable_id: r.id, synced_at: new Date().toISOString() };\n  const fields = r.fields || r;\n  for (const [k, v] of Object.entries(fields)) {\n    if (k === 'id' || k === 'createdTime') continue;\n    out[k] = Array.isArray(v) ? v.map((x) => (x && typeof x === 'object' ? (x.name || x.url || JSON.stringify(x)) : x)).join(', ')\n      : v && typeof v === 'object' ? JSON.stringify(v) : v;\n  }\n  return { json: out };\n});"
      },
      "id": "91ee75fc-ccbb-5fbb-af20-0a1b2e163315",
      "name": "Flatten for the sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [
            "airtable_id"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW",
          "handlingExtraData": "ignoreIt"
        }
      },
      "id": "e384c201-4da3-53b8-baf3-0b15c226230d",
      "name": "Add or update sheet rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Airtable table to Google Sheets sync (hourly)\nCopies every record of an Airtable table into a Google Sheet each hour, adding new records and updating changed ones.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a0276747-d32a-58f3-a9bb-4a153d2515a7",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a Google Sheet tab **Airtable copy** with headers `airtable_id`, `synced_at` and then your Airtable field names, spelt exactly the same.\n2. Open **Settings**: Airtable base and table URLs, sheet URL.\n3. Add an Airtable personal access token credential (data.records:read) and connect Google Sheets.\n4. Run once: every record appears in the sheet, then each hour new records are added and changed ones updated (matched on airtable_id).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "d751b14e-18ac-50cd-b2a6-c8b8d18c9a2f",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -420
      ]
    }
  ],
